DATA — no open licence is set yet

The derived data under data/ and the tables under downloads/ are dissertation
material. Data are provided for research use; please cite the atlas (see
CITATION.cff) and, for expression data, the underlying study. A formal open
licence has not been set; Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(CC BY 4.0) is intended at publication.

Upstream data carries its own terms:
  - 717 v5.1 genome and annotation — Phytozome / JGI, subject to the JGI data
    use policy for the relevant release.
  - Public RNA-seq — the 38 BioProjects listed in data/expr/studies.json,
    each with its own citation and DOI.
